<p>Perversely<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-738269-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-738269-1')">1</a></sup>, it kind of smacks of wish fulfillment. I mean, not for the author necessarily, but for a certain kind of person who plays video games. &quot;Wow, wouldn't it be cool if I could play seven video games at once and it would be as good as sex because girls never want to talk to me so fuck them I'll just play video games all day.&quot;</p>
